$ pda help del-db
$ pda del-db --help
Delete a database

Usage:
  pda del-db DB [flags]

Aliases:
  del-db, delete-db, rm-db, remove-db

Flags:
  -h, --help          help for del-db
  -i, --interactive   Prompt yes/no for each deletion
